    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "MatchClean Inc.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117653900991340544833/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVNG_7jp_7GZgxMKmL_WHaa78eY9KzAe1tALfzyigW8YIfkCwE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "We used Duct Masters for our air duct cleaning, they also offer air quality testing through Air Masters. We used them for our new home in the Westmount / Downtown area to make sure all the air was safe after major renovations. The number we elevated but their offer excellent solutions to lower the numbers without any further cost. Great Montreal company.",
        "time": 1706629253,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Steph",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113297143194608140446/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLFmEKMJWx2PAuciR8bYA8LXrFyLff4AcPhfKJIRQTDog4HhA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Very professional & courteous company. The inspection & analysis were done thoroughly by Mr. Doucet who addressed all of our concerns as well as giving us advice on how to mitigate the issues we were dealing with. A comprehensive report was sent within 24hrs, and Mr. Doucet made himself available to address any further inquiries. I am having him come back to run tests in different environment settings because I trust his work and because I like the service he gives. Highly recommend him.",
        "time": 1571843726,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Derek Mancini",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108740192333652669289/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJhMCDndSVUoabd4liMrdLRGozMUumYTGQ8h26YVYqv8ER2ziA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Very Professional and very informative, with results the next day.\n“What more can you ask for”\n\nWe recently had an Air quality test and thermal imaging test done. The reports we received were detailed and clear, and for each issue, a list of potential causes and recommended actions to take.\n\nWould highly recommend.",
        "time": 1603195802,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andrew Laramee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115664713202649926445/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWadnzzuoQYh2ksS1dmWRB94mmAmX03GqZV7lF3nHg7nY3qcDv5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "I called to inquire about a mold test for my basement and they explained my options very clearly. It was recommended to initially buy a DIY mold kit to assess whether or not there was a mold issue and to call them back if needed as their services were much more advanced, thorough and expensive. It's great to hear such a professional and trustworthy response to my situation and I will be dealing with them for all of my future air quality needs.",
        "time": 1596200563,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Loni Cornax",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101587936810666566144/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJREamkXp0etJM-Um5kMJCsImDilB-5YkJcUlTCMuFNvKTnMw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend Air Masters.  Recently they performed air quality and thermal imaging tests in my home.   The tests were throughly explained to me and the next day I received detailed, clear reports of the results as well as recommendations for addressing any issues which was very informative and helpful!",
        "time": 1572914457,
        "translated": false
